// 06_orifice.hcx - converted from .hcx by PHCP 1.0.0.
// Comments in the .hcx file are not carried over.
// Dropped from the .hcx because they had no effect on the result:
//   line 29: OPTIONS TRACE NONE - not an option the .hcx reader acts on

Units    FLOW=LPM PRESSURE=KPA LENGTH=M DIAMETER=MM
Method   HW
Option   ORIF_STEP 0.5

Node     SRC 0.0
Node     J1 0.0
Node     A 0.0
Node     A2 0.0
Node     B 0.0
Node     B2 0.0

Use      BORE
Pipe     M1 SRC J1 20.0 100.0 C=120
Pipe     P1 J1 A 12.0 50.0 C=120
Pipe     P2 J1 B 12.0 50.0 C=120

Orifice  OP1 A A2 DP=150 DN=50
Orifice  OP2 B B2 BORE=26 DN=50

Supply   SUP1 SRC STATIC 1000

Hydrant  H1 A2 Q=400 P=200
Hydrant  H2 B2 Q=400 P=200
